abstract: >-
  Interactive video retrieval system for the Video Browser Showdown (VBS) 2027:
  WeMM-Embedding-4B retrieval with Qdrant HNSW and reciprocal rank fusion,
  conversational refinement, evidence-aware VQA with abstention and intra-video browsing.
